# Production build overrides (loaded ONLY by `vite build`, i.e. mode=production).
#
# Vite loads `.env` in every mode, then lets `.env.[mode]` override it. `.env`
# holds the LOCAL dev values (VITE_APP_URL=http://localhost:8080) and is
# gitignored; this file pins the deployed OfferLyst origin for production
# builds, so `npm run extension:build` can never silently ship an extension
# that points users at a local dev server.
#
# Committed on purpose: this is a public URL, not a secret. Supabase URL/anon
# key are intentionally NOT duplicated here — `.env` supplies those in all
# modes.
#
# On a domain change, update this AND `PRODUCTION_APP_ORIGIN` in
# src/shared/constants.ts (that constant is the fallback + the MV3 host
# permission; this file is the build-time value).
VITE_APP_ENV=production
VITE_APP_URL=https://ishantsinghiitb-svg-final-project.ishantsingh-iitb.workers.dev
